`writing-systems/orwell.md` quotes six rules from "Politics and the English
Language" by George Orwell, first published 1946. Orwell died in 1950. The essay
is in the public domain in the United Kingdom, the European Union, and other
countries with a life-plus-70-years term. The six rules are quoted as a short
extract.

ASD-STE100 Simplified Technical English is a specification of the AeroSpace and
Defence Industries Association of Europe. It is free to read at
https://asd-ste100.org and it is copyrighted. No part of this repository
reproduces it.
